  "normalized": "For the year ended December 31, 2024, sales to Phillips 66 Company accounted for approximately 19% of the Company’s total product sales. For the year ended December 31, 2023, sales to Phillips 66 Company and Gunvor USA LLC accounted for approximately 20% and 14%, respectively, of the Company’s total product sales. No other purchasers accounted for more than 10% of the Company’s total sales for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 or 2023.",
